 "title": "Valid Orientations for Mechanical Belts",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "Belts cannot connect in arbitrary directions",
  "text_2": "1. They can connect horizontally",
  "text_3": "2. They can connect diagonally",
  "text_4": "3. They can connect vertically",
  "text_5": "4. And they can connect vertical shafts horizontally",
  "text_6": "These are all possible directions. Belts can span any Length between 2 and 20 blocks"
